From f4d38f55bff430dcbfcb0ed9efc6bb893e1269f0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jeff Hutchins <jeff@currentclient.com>
Date: Wed, 10 Jun 2026 10:35:39 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 03/12] feat(expo): ship first-party Expo config plugin

Adds an Expo config plugin (app.plugin.js + plugin/index.js) that
encapsulates all native project mutations previously maintained in
cc-mob-app's config/plugins/withTwilioVoiceReactNative.js:

- iOS Info.plist: UIBackgroundModes (audio, voip) and NSUserActivityTypes
  (INStartAudioCallIntent, INStartCallIntent)
- iOS Xcode project: HEADER_SEARCH_PATHS entry for the SDK ios/ directory
- Android: calling/foreground-service permissions and the VoiceService
  manifest entry
- Optional app-provided services via props: android.messagingServiceClass
  (custom Firebase messaging service) and android.phoneCallServiceClass
  (phoneCall foreground service, with phoneCallServiceStopWithTask)

Package changes for consumption as a git dependency:
- version 1.7.0-cc.1, app.plugin.js and plugin/ added to files
- prepare script renamed to build:lib so consumer installs use the
  committed lib/ output instead of rebuilding (lib/ is tracked in-tree)
- README documents the fork's delta, consumption, and upstream tracking

PRO-3980

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
